00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:55.390
- [Narrator] Deep in
the suburbs of Moscow,

00:00:55.390 --> 00:00:57.230
in a town called Novoselki,

00:00:57.230 --> 00:00:59.510
Sergey and his comrades tirelessly work

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:01.560
on a pretty unique hobby.

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:04.180
Through years of
experimenting and prototyping,

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:06.760
they've taught themselves
how to build life-size tanks

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:08.100
out of a garage,

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:10.829
all in the name of
celebrating Russian history.

